Consolidate request form into the dashboard modal, relax device-info fields

Power Login is now Admin-only in the sidebar (still Dev-only at the
controller level too). Widened the New Request modal. Device Name/MAC/
Cellular/LAN Laptop ID/IP Address can't be reliably auto-fetched from
a browser - there's no client-side API for local hardware info - so
they're now optional instead of required; IP address is pre-filled
server-side from the request's own connection as a partial win, since
that one is actually knowable without any client cooperation.

Removed the standalone Request.cshtml page/SubmitRequest GET action -
it duplicated every field in the dashboard modal, which is now the
only place to submit a request. The sidebar "New Request" link and a
failed-validation redirect both send the user back to the dashboard
with the modal auto-reopened.
